\par }{\b\f1 Command Syntax:\tab AT#UD\tab 
\par }{\f1 
\par Note: an ITU recommendation would be of the form AT+<name>, as per V.250.
\par 
\par }{\b\f1 Description
\par }{\f1 
\par #UD is an action command.  It does not take parameters.  
\par It shall be the last command in the command line.
\par 
\par Modems conforming to this specification shall log aspects of their operation for each call, and save these results until cleared by one of the following events:
\par 
