\par Req08\tab =\tab Required for implementations of version 0.8 or later
\par ReqIF\tab =\tab Required only if the associated capability is supported by the DCE
\par Rec10\tab =\tab Recommended for all implementations
\par 
\par Note that versions up to and including 0.8 did not include implementation requirements.
