\par }\pard\plain \widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\f1 
\par This document has been public in some form for over a year, but the 1.0 version of this is still weeks away.  The issue is: what level of compliance is essential to meet the requirements of PC 98?
\par As shown in Tables 1-9, there are three levels of compliance: 0.8, 0.9 and 1.0.
\par Req08 is intended to respect prototype implementations generated in advance of version 0.9.
\par The devices from key technology providers all meet this level.
